Staying informed isn't what wears you out. The headline feed is: one alarm after another, no context, no end, so your body stays on alert after you already have the facts.

Next time you notice your jaw is clenched mid-scroll: drop your shoulders, take 3 to 5 slow breaths (in for 4, out for 6), then decide on purpose whether to keep reading.

We're building DeRot to pause your apps for exactly that reset. Full guide: {url}

